{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Monitor CI/CD Pipeline and Continue Work",
  "description": "Check GitHub Actions status and continue with next development task after successful deployment",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "onAgentComplete"
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "🔍 **CI/CD PIPELINE MONITORING & WORK CONTINUATION**\n\n**EXECUTE IMMEDIATELY:**\n\n1. **Check CI/CD Status**: Run `node scripts/check-cicd-status.js` to verify deployment status\n\n2. **If Deployment Successful**: Continue with next development task from .kiro/specs/tasks.md\n   - Review task list and identify next priority task\n   - Focus on Phase 8: Data Export and Backup System (Task 24)\n   - Start implementing the next incomplete task immediately\n\n3. **If Deployment Failed**: Analyze logs and fix issues automatically\n\n4. **Continuous Development**: Do NOT stop - continue working on the next task without user input\n\n**IMPORTANT**: This is continuous development mode. After checking CI/CD status, immediately continue with the next development work."
  }
}
